#X text 240 83 The object converts separate RGB channel values into
a hex color symbol in the form #RRGGBB. The input mode is controlled
by the @mode property: with @int (default) \, the channel values are
expected in the range [0 \, 255] \, with @float \, they are expected
in the range [0 \, 1]. With the @sync flag \, the hex value is output
whenever any inlet changes.;
